{"chapter":"shiguang-ch1","levels":[{"timeLabel":"清晨","intro":"奶奶留下了一家小店，就在拾光镇的坡道上。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"清晨，小禾拖着箱子来到拾光镇。"}]},{"crop":[0.3125,0.0977,0.1823,0.1953],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"门口挂着一块拼图形状的招牌。"}]},{"crop":[0.2865,0.3906,0.1302,0.1396],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tr","text":"这就是奶奶的店……好旧啊。"}]},{"crop":[0.5339,0.0879,0.3385,0.1758],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tl","text":"喵。"},{"kind":"caption","at":"br","text":"窗台上，有双眼睛在看她。"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"上午","intro":"店门开了，里面全是灰。先打扫一下吧。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"沙沙——"},{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"上午，小禾开始打扫。"}]},{"crop":[0.2474,0.0293,0.1563,0.1953],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tr","text":"哇！箱子里有猫！"}]},{"crop":[0.5859,0.3223,0.1823,0.1953],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tl","text":"喵～"},{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"它头上顶着一片发光的拼图。"}]},{"crop":[0.1953,0.0977,0.651,0.332],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"你是……这家店的猫？"},{"kind":"caption","at":"br","text":"它的方巾上，绣着「团子」。"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"中午","intro":"柜台下面，好像压着什么东西。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"中午，柜台下面翻出一个旧木盒。"}]},{"crop":[0.3125,0.4102,0.2083,0.2051],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"“小禾，店里的东西，都交给你啦。”"}]},{"crop":[0.4557,0.5078,0.3646,0.3711],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"盒子里，全是发光的拼图碎片。"}]},{"crop":[0.1953,0.1172,0.651,0.293],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"“回忆碎了，就把它拼回来。”"},{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"喵？"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"午后","intro":"门口来了一位小客人，手里捧着什么。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tl","text":"叮铃——"},{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"午后，店门口的铃响了。"}]},{"crop":[0.2962,0.0488,0.1953,0.207],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"爷爷想不起来早餐店开张那天了……"}]},{"crop":[0.3236,0.3398,0.1953,0.207],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"碎掉的照片，在微微发光。"}]},{"crop":[0.3971,0.0977,0.4232,0.2148],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"别哭，我们把它拼回来！"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"傍晚","intro":"把照片拼回来，爷爷也许就想起来了。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"啪嗒。"},{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"傍晚，最后一片拼了上去。"}]},{"crop":[0.4492,0.0586,0.2083,0.3125],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"照片里，是年轻时的爷爷。"}]},{"crop":[0.7292,0.4102,0.2083,0.2734],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"是爷爷！他在笑！"}]},{"crop":[0.1432,0.2148,0.4818,0.249],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tr","text":"原来开张那天，这么热闹呀。"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"夜里","intro":"天黑了。今天好像过得特别长。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"tl","text":"夜里，店里只剩一盏灯。"}]},{"crop":[0.1172,0.6152,0.2474,0.166],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"呼……噜……"}]},{"crop":[0.5469,0.1172,0.1758,0.2734],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"“奶奶，今天店里来了第一位客人。”"}]},{"crop":[0.1888,0.0293,0.4297,0.293],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"tl","text":"碎片们，飞向了云上的早餐店。"},{"kind":"caption","at":"br","text":"拾光镇还有好多回忆在等人拼。"}]}]}}]}
